n//     for all active group members (leaveDate IS NULL) with isAbsent = false.\n//     Teacher updates isAbsent during or after the lesson. isAbsent does NOT\n//     affect student active/inactive status — attendance is for tracking only.\n//\n// 19. Group.endDate > Group.startDate — enforced by DB CHECK constraint\n//     (group_date_order in data_integrity_constraints.sql).\n//\n// 20. TeacherAvailability overlap — validate in application code that a teacher's\n//     availability blocks for the same dayOfWeek don't overlap in time.\n//\n// 21. Permanent teacher change — when a group's teacher is permanently changed\n//     (not a one-off substitution): update Group.teacherId, close the current\n//     GroupTeacherHistory record (set endDate), create a new one, and update ALL\n//     future SCHEDULED lessons' teacherId AND originalTeacherId to the new\n//     teacher. Swap TeacherScheduleSlots for those lessons. This ensures\n//     teacherId != originalTeacherId on a Lesson always means a substitution,\n//     never a permanent reassignment.\n//\n// 22. mergedIntoGroupId — can only be set when Group.type = GROUP. Individual\n//     lessons cannot be merged.\n//\n// 23. Group graduation — admin triggers when no SCHEDULED/PENDING_RESOLUTION\n//     lessons remain (all COMPLETED or CANCELLED, including replacements).\n//     Skip if skipAutoGraduation = true or level = IELTS. Otherwise:\n//     create new group at next level (same teacher, days, startTime, durationMinutes,\n//     maxStudents, progressStage = BEGINNING). startDate = next valid lesson date\n//     after old group's last lesson (matching day pattern, skipping holidays).\n//     endDate auto-calculated. Price is determined by PriceSetting (looked up\n//     from the new group's level category + type). Create\n//     GroupTeacherHistory + pre-create lessons/slots. Admin selects continuing\n//     students → new memberships with previousMembershipId (which triggers\n//     billing period pre-creation pe